The problem initailly by #URL.getPath(), this will not work if URL file path have any space. So HADOOP-15217 fix is to change URL.toURI() which handle space issue. Now, there is another problem with URI. If URI contains relative/opaque file path, then path will be null in URI object. 

I think only change that work for both file and hdfs schema is,
{code:java}
