if(uri.isOpaque() && uri.getScheme().equals("file")) {
 is = fs.open(new Path(uri.getSchemeSpecificPart()));
 } else {
 is = fs.open(new Path(uri));
 }

{code}
 

Thanks [~bharatviswa] for offline discussion. 

[~daryn] [~weichiu] Would you please suggest if any?

