Fine. Can do it in another issue if current interval+count does not work.

[~amuraru], agreed.

[~apurtell], the default is max retries is 10 (i.e. 10s with the default sleep interval). For socket timeouts that is too small (I think).
In fact I see the following comment as to why socket timeouts are handled differently:
{code}
            // This exception means we waited for more than 60s and nothing
