To answer this question, it hasn't been published yet. We're on our 3rd release candidate, which so far looks good. The vote is scheduled to close on Tuesday 12 July. If you'd like more details, check out the thread on dev@ '[VOTE] Third release candidate for HBase 1.2.2 (RC2)'.

