-      if (ch == '\\' && in.length() > i+1 && in.charAt(i+1) == 'x') {
{code}
Can you take a second look ?

No the patch is not the same as current code. See this boundary check:
{code}
+        char next = i+1 < in.length() ? in.charAt(i+1) : ch; // check for array out of bounds
